### {{ entity.replace('_', ' ')|title }} Semantic Search

{% if search_schema.kind == "FILES" %}Search the text content of your {{ entity.replace('_', ' ') }} by meaning rather than by exact keywords. Airbyte extracts each file's text, embeds a natural-language `prompt`, and returns the most similar passages of file content, ranked by relevance, each carrying its source-file attribution (such as name and path). Pass `semantic={field, prompt, filter?, context_size?, min_similarity?, dedup?}` to `context_store_search` instead of `query`. Only available in hosted mode.
{% else %}Search {{ entity.replace('_', ' ') }} records by meaning rather than by exact or fuzzy field values. Semantic search embeds a natural-language `prompt` and returns the most similar passages, ranked by relevance. Pass `semantic={field, prompt, filter?, context_size?, min_similarity?, dedup?}` to `context_store_search` instead of `query`. Only available in hosted mode.
{% endif %}

#### CLI

```bash
airbyte-agent connectors execute --json '{
  "workspace": "<your_workspace_name>",
  "name": "{{ connector_name }}",
  "entity": "{{ entity }}",
  "action": "context_store_search",
  "params": {
    "semantic": {"field": "{{ semantic_field.name }}", "prompt": "<your natural-language query>"}
  }
}'
```

#### Python SDK

Semantic search is passed through the generic `execute` method — the typed `{{ entity }}.context_store_search` helper only accepts `query`.

```python
await {{ connector_instance_name }}.execute(
    "{{ entity }}",
    "context_store_search",
    {"semantic": {"field": "{{ semantic_field.name }}", "prompt": "<your natural-language query>"}},
)
```

#### API

```bash
curl --location 'https://api.airbyte.ai/api/v1/integrations/connectors/{your_connector_id}/execute' \
--header 'Content-Type: application/json' \
--header 'Authorization: Bearer {your_auth_token}' \
--data '{
    "entity": "{{ entity }}",
    "action": "context_store_search",
    "params": {
        "semantic": {"field": "{{ semantic_field.name }}", "prompt": "<your natural-language query>"}
    }
}'
```

#### Semantic Parameters

| Parameter Name | Type | Required | Description |
|----------------|------|----------|-------------|
| `semantic.field` | `string` | Yes | Field to search semantically. Mutually exclusive with `query`. |
| `semantic.prompt` | `string` | Yes | Natural-language query that is embedded and compared against stored passages. |
| `semantic.filter` | `object` | No | Filter conditions (same shape/operators as `query.filter`). `sort` is not supported — results are ranked by similarity. |
| `semantic.context_size` | `integer` | No | Characters of surrounding context to return per hit, up to the field's configured window. Omit to return the full configured window. |
| `semantic.min_similarity` | `number` | No | Minimum similarity score in [{{ semantic_min_similarity }}, {{ semantic_max_similarity }}]. Omit for {{ semantic_default_min_similarity }}; scores below the threshold are discarded before deduplication and top-k selection. Use {{ semantic_min_similarity }} to disable the cutoff. |
| `semantic.dedup` | `string` | No | `max` (default) returns the single best-scoring passage per record; `none` returns multiple passages per record, still ranked by similarity and capped by `limit`. |
| `fields` | `array` | No | Field paths to include in results (dot notation for nested fields). Applied to each hit's `entity`. |
| `limit` | `integer` | No | Maximum results to return (default 10, maximum 100). |

